# Pathways — Resources Page & Blog System Spec
> For Claude: Read DESIGN_TOKENS.md, COMPONENT_SPEC.md, and pathways-desktop-first-responsive.md before this file. This spec covers three things: (1) the public /resources page on the marketing website, (2) the /admin/blog dashboard on the platform, and (3) the shared Supabase schema and API routes that power both. Build each section in order.

---

## 1. Architecture Overview

```
Marketing Website (pathways.app)
  /resources                    ← Public page, two tabs: Articles + Resources
  /resources/[slug]             ← Individual post/resource page

Platform (app.pathways.app)
  /admin/blog                   ← Post list, drafts, published
  /admin/blog/new               ← AI post generator + manual editor
  /admin/blog/[id]/edit         ← Edit existing post
  /admin/resources/new          ← URL import + auto-fill form

Shared
  Supabase Postgres             ← Single posts table for both sites
  Next.js Route Handlers        ← URL scraper, Claude generation
```

